@startuml
title Pati — AI Serving, GPU Kuyruklama ve Dayanıklılık
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
component "AI Gateway" as GW
component "Admission Control" as AC
component "Model Router" as R
queue "Realtime Queue" as RT
queue "Batch / 3D Queue" as BQ
component "CPU Inference Pool" as CPU
component "GPU Online Pool" as GPU
component "GPU Batch Pool" as BGPU
component "Autoscaler" as AS
component "Model Cache" as Cache
database "Artifact Registry" as AR
component "Result Store" as RS
component "Cost / Latency Monitor" as MON
component "Circuit Breaker" as CB
GW --> AC : tenant/user quota
AC --> R : task + SLA + budget
R --> RT : sağlık/vision düşük gecikme
R --> BQ : 3D/maskot async job
RT --> CPU : küçük model / kural
RT --> GPU : LLM/vision
BQ --> BGPU : reconstruction/texture
AR --> Cache
Cache --> CPU
Cache --> GPU
Cache --> BGPU
CPU --> RS
GPU --> RS
BGPU --> RS
AS --> GPU : queue depth + utilization
AS --> BGPU
MON --> CB : hata/maliyet/gecikme
CB --> R : fallback / model kapatma
note bottom
Öncelik: acil sağlık yönlendirmesi > interaktif kalite kontrolü >
öneri > 3D/maskot batch. Kullanıcı başına kota, job iptali,
checkpoint, timeout ve tahmini bitiş süresi vardır.
GPU maliyeti model/sürüm/özellik/tenant bazında ölçülür.
end note
@enduml
